{"4535740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BattleFrame", "steam_appid": 4535740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MOBILIZE // FIGHT // EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BattleFrame</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person mecha action shooter that looks to bring back the weight and tension of classic mech combat. Step into the role of a <strong>Strider</strong>, warriors-for-hire that are contracted throughout the <strong>Frontier</strong> by one of three warring factions: the Greater Vostok Union, the Kossak Republics, and the Pyrats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy across an array of fractured theatres — dense forest worlds, crumbling industrial wastelands, cosmo-stations - and experience intense <strong>PvE</strong> engagements, either <strong>Singleplayer</strong> or <strong>Co-Op</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a vast arsenal from long-range rifles to massive melee weaponry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your BattleFrame - swap out parts and upgrade your machine with powerful <strong>Attachments</strong> and<strong> Modules</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk it all in 1v1 <strong>PvP </strong>deathmatches against rival Striders.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MOBILIZE // FIGHT // EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BattleFrame</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person mecha action shooter that looks to bring back the weight and tension of classic mech combat. Step into the role of a <strong>Strider</strong>, warriors-for-hire that are contracted throughout the <strong>Frontier</strong> by one of three warring factions: the Greater Vostok Union, the Kossak Republics, and the Pyrats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy across an array of fractured theatres — dense forest worlds, crumbling industrial wastelands, cosmo-stations - and experience intense <strong>PvE</strong> engagements, either <strong>Singleplayer</strong> or <strong>Co-Op</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a vast arsenal from long-range rifles to massive melee weaponry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your BattleFrame - swap out parts and upgrade your machine with powerful <strong>Attachments</strong> and<strong> Modules</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk it all in 1v1 <strong>PvP </strong>deathmatches against rival Striders.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BattleFrame is a mecha extraction shooter, set in a retrofuture cosmos ravaged by war. Engage in Single-Player and Co-Op missions, or fight against enemy Striders in winner-take-all deathmatches.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535740/12e945981fc19b98a194368755d28a6f7488cf60/header.jpg?t=1774397171", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535740/3e123f1428a84f71a4af8f76d8fee15c9becd53d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774397171", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535740/3e123f1428a84f71a4af8f76d8fee15c9becd53d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774397171", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3-4130 or Core™ i5-3470 or AMD FX™-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GT 1030 (DDR4) or AMD Radeon™ RX 550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB ava